meshfs-dokan
============

A port of the user-mode protocol of Dokany's dokan2.dll (Dokany v2.3.1.1000,
https://github.com/dokan-dev/dokany, tag v2.3.1.1000) to Rust, built as the
separate, replaceable library meshfs_dokan.dll behind a versioned C ABI
(include/meshfs_dokan.h).

