Ported from Dokany
------------------

The driver structures, constants and IOCTL codes (src/proto.rs) are ported from
Dokany's sys/public.h. The protocol and marshalling logic (src/marshal/,
src/win/) is ported from Dokany's user-mode library dokan2.dll (dokan/dokan.c,
create.c, directory.c, fileinfo.c, setfile.c, volume.c, security.c, read.c,
write.c, cleanup.c, close.c, flush.c, lock.c, timeout.c, access.c, mount.c).
